```
npx tsc --noEmit                 OK
npm run build:server             OK (dist/server.cjs 19.4mb)
cd packages/web && npx next build  OK
npm run check:encoding           OK (no BOM, no mojibake, all JSON valid)
npm test (protocol suite)        OK - 36 tests
src/protocol/__tests__/run.ts    OK (§9.2/§9.3 replay)
```

## Notes for O4

- Replay via `eventsAfterSeq(sessionId, n)` is ready; `socket.ts` still calls the
  cursor form `eventsAfter(sessionId, lastMessageId)`, which resolves the cursor
  through `seqOfId`.
- `clear()` drops only the in-memory cache (the durable log is untouched).
- The remaining `dist/` build artifacts are from the gates above.
